1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Fifth Episode
The Monsters of the Three Valleys

15
00:02:14,581 --> 00:02:16,617
Are you saying this rose is poisonous?

16
00:02:16,821 --> 00:02:20,018
Yes, indeed. My wife pricked her finger on a thorn...

17
00:02:20,061 --> 00:02:24,015
...and then she danced for three days until she died from it. Poor little wife!

18
00:02:26,261 --> 00:02:28,411
And how is it there are two coffins?

19
00:02:29,360 --> 00:02:31,010
Sir, my son is in the other.

20
00:02:31,061 --> 00:02:33,336
The only antidote to the rose's poison...

21
00:02:33,381 --> 00:02:35,258
...is an herb found in the Three Valleys...

22
00:02:35,301 --> 00:02:38,134
...and my son had gone right down there to look for this herb!

23
00:02:38,461 --> 00:02:40,497
He had the courage to go there?!

24
00:02:40,541 --> 00:02:42,816
I heard that there are monsters in the Three Valleys!

25
00:02:42,861 --> 00:02:46,410
Yes, he was surprised by one of them at the entrance to the first valley.

26
00:02:46,461 --> 00:02:48,417
The monster wounded him and then...

27
00:03:00,974 --> 00:03:04,696
Sapphire!
Don't you know that roses have thorns?

28
00:03:07,661 --> 00:03:09,410
Good morning, mother!
I picked it for you!

29
00:03:09,741 --> 00:03:13,620
Every morning you give me a rose. How sweet you are!

30
00:03:13,661 --> 00:03:16,459
I will give you one every morning until your birthday!

31
00:03:16,501 --> 00:03:18,077
What color do you want tomorrow?

32
00:03:18,102 --> 00:03:19,819
I would like a red rose.

33
00:03:19,843 --> 00:03:21,174
I will bring it to you!

34
00:03:21,421 --> 00:03:22,831
Be careful!

35
00:03:22,855 --> 00:03:24,295
Don't worry, mom!

36
00:03:29,920 --> 00:03:31,230
What a spirited child.

37
00:03:33,341 --> 00:03:34,818
A red rose, huh?

38
00:04:34,620 --> 00:04:38,993
What a beautiful morning! I will go
immediately to pick a rose for my mother!

39
00:04:48,221 --> 00:04:50,018
Hooray!

40
00:05:25,421 --> 00:05:28,379
These are the last moments of
happiness for you, Prince Sapphire!

41
00:05:28,404 --> 00:05:31,038
You will die as soon as you
touch a thorn of the red rose!

42
00:05:45,821 --> 00:05:47,023
Wait!

43
00:05:48,381 --> 00:05:49,930
Wait, please!

44
00:05:53,407 --> 00:05:54,967
Please wait!

45
00:05:55,207 --> 00:05:56,868
This morning I want to
pick it myself for Sapphire.

46
00:05:59,941 --> 00:06:03,238
What is wrong, Baron Nylon,
that you look at me this way?

47
00:06:04,961 --> 00:06:07,436
How are you, Queen?

48
00:06:07,461 --> 00:06:10,612
A strange energy
compels me to dance!

49
00:06:11,374 --> 00:06:15,261
Good heavens! Sapphire was supposed to prick
herself and the Queen pricked herself instead!

50
00:06:15,726 --> 00:06:18,285
What will happen now? That poison
takes effect immediately and is deadly!

51
00:06:21,120 --> 00:06:23,138
Help me stop!
Please!

52
00:06:23,180 --> 00:06:25,615
I beg you, do something!

53
00:06:25,660 --> 00:06:29,017
I can't stop anymore! Help!

54
00:06:29,060 --> 00:06:32,292
- What is the matter?
- My feet are dragging me!

55
00:06:32,340 --> 00:06:34,181
I understand: she pricked
herself with a poisonous flower!

56
00:06:34,205 --> 00:06:36,003
What a tragedy!

57
00:06:38,500 --> 00:06:40,249
Mother! Tell me, what is wrong with you?

58
00:06:41,900 --> 00:06:44,574
Damn it! I didn't expect it
to be the Queen herself...

59
00:06:44,620 --> 00:06:46,691
...to prick herself
with that poisonous rose!

60
00:06:46,740 --> 00:06:48,732
What are you saying?
She will only live for three days?!

61
00:06:48,780 --> 00:06:51,011
Yes, Prince.
We are dismayed.

62
00:06:51,060 --> 00:06:54,130
- Her fever is too high.
- It will take her straight to the grave.

63
00:06:54,154 --> 00:06:55,197
Mother!

64
00:06:57,460 --> 00:06:58,681
Help!

65
00:06:58,705 --> 00:06:59,452
Mother!

66
00:07:01,020 --> 00:07:02,898
Alas!

67
00:07:03,580 --> 00:07:05,265
Is there a medicine to cure her?

68
00:07:05,289 --> 00:07:08,849
The only remedy is to put
a specific herb on the wounds.

69
00:07:09,060 --> 00:07:11,824
Quick, go gather
this herb and bring it here!

70
00:07:12,460 --> 00:07:15,578
I am sorry, Prince, but the herb
grows in the Three Valleys...

71
00:07:15,620 --> 00:07:17,896
...and whoever went down there
has never returned.

72
00:07:18,180 --> 00:07:21,571
It wouldn't happen to be that place where rumors
say some monsters live?

73
00:07:21,620 --> 00:07:23,373
Exactly, that's the one!

74
00:07:23,420 --> 00:07:25,616
I will order someone
to go there immediately!

75
00:07:28,700 --> 00:07:30,055
I order you to go there!

76
00:07:30,079 --> 00:07:31,615
But I'm afraid!

77
00:07:31,640 --> 00:07:33,934
Coward! Are you afraid of monsters?
Then, you go!

78
00:07:33,959 --> 00:07:36,011
You know, Prince,
my wife is sick.

79
00:07:36,060 --> 00:07:38,575
I have children!
If I die, what will become of them?

80
00:07:38,620 --> 00:07:41,010
I don't feel very well.

81
00:07:41,420 --> 00:07:43,889
Cowards! Alright,
then I will go myself!

82
00:07:44,260 --> 00:07:46,650
Magnificent! I still get
what I was hoping for!

83
00:07:46,700 --> 00:07:49,169
If Sapphire goes down there, she
will be devoured by the monsters!

84
00:07:49,220 --> 00:07:52,930
We cannot allow anything to
happen to the Crown Prince!

85
00:07:53,460 --> 00:07:54,333
I will go!

86
00:07:54,357 --> 00:07:55,679
Wait, Your Highness!

87
00:07:55,953 --> 00:07:58,816
Let a faithful
General of yours...

88
00:07:58,860 --> 00:08:00,497
...go there at
the risk of his life!

89
00:08:00,800 --> 00:08:05,397
Today's young soldiers
are nothing but weaklings!

90
00:08:13,020 --> 00:08:14,358
I am forced to go myself!

91
00:08:14,382 --> 00:08:16,397
- Sapphire!
- May heaven protect you!

92
00:08:25,290 --> 00:08:26,290
Tink!

93
00:08:26,860 --> 00:08:29,354
Sapphire! Is it true that the Queen
pricked herself with a poisonous rose?

94
00:08:29,500 --> 00:08:32,734
Yes! And now I'm going to the Three Valleys
to pick the herb that will cure her!

95
00:08:34,260 --> 00:08:36,013
Sapphire, wait!

96
00:08:39,620 --> 00:08:42,089
What? Sapphire went alone?!
But it's dangerous!

97
00:08:42,140 --> 00:08:44,894
Nylon, immediately send
some soldiers to help him...

98
00:08:44,941 --> 00:08:46,110
...and choose the strongest!

99
00:08:46,134 --> 00:08:46,610
Yes, yes, Sire!

100
00:08:50,421 --> 00:08:52,365
Instead, I sent
the weakest soldiers!

101
00:09:35,680 --> 00:09:38,941
That's the florist! I recognize him!
What is he doing in this place?

102
00:09:40,521 --> 00:09:43,133
I injured my leg
and I can no longer walk.

103
00:09:43,621 --> 00:09:45,373
It's the fault of that cursed monster!

104
00:09:45,421 --> 00:09:47,025
Were you attacked by the monster?!

105
00:09:47,160 --> 00:09:49,258
No, I fell on the rocks.

106
00:09:49,301 --> 00:09:51,957
I came here to try
to avenge my son's death.

107
00:09:53,187 --> 00:09:54,731
Injured like that, you won't succeed.

108
00:09:54,781 --> 00:09:56,897
Don't worry, I will avenge you!

109
00:09:56,941 --> 00:09:59,819
Take this waterskin of water,
Highness! It will help you!

110
00:09:59,861 --> 00:10:00,990
What should I do with it?

111
00:10:01,014 --> 00:10:02,011
Legend says...

112
00:10:02,061 --> 00:10:04,256
...that the monster of the first valley
must be confronted...

113
00:10:04,301 --> 00:10:07,092
With water, not with the sword

114
00:10:12,821 --> 00:10:15,381
Damn, I suffer from vertigo!

115
00:10:44,800 --> 00:10:46,026
There it is!

116
00:11:08,429 --> 00:11:09,429
You monster!

117
00:11:50,221 --> 00:11:52,018
I can't hurt it!

118
00:11:59,821 --> 00:12:00,773
Damn it!

119
00:12:07,661 --> 00:12:10,694
Help! Let me go!

120
00:12:18,461 --> 00:12:20,090
He saw us!


121
00:12:20,115 --> 00:12:23,609
Don't run away! Wait!

122
00:12:23,634 --> 00:12:25,138
Come back! Help me!

123
00:12:33,061 --> 00:12:35,655
The monster of the first
valley must be faced...

124
00:12:35,701 --> 00:12:37,103
...with water, not
with the sword!

125
00:12:38,101 --> 00:12:39,341
Right, water! I'll
splash it with this!

126
00:12:50,787 --> 00:12:52,785
Incredible! The
water is killing it!

127
00:13:15,741 --> 00:13:17,284
Something came out of its mouth!

128
00:13:18,741 --> 00:13:21,653
The first day is about to
end. I only have two days...

129
00:13:21,701 --> 00:13:24,579
...before my mother dies
exhausted, poisoned by the venom.

130
00:13:24,603 --> 00:13:27,164
I must get past the other
two monsters. I must hurry!

131
00:13:28,861 --> 00:13:29,868
I'll take this with me.
It will give me light!

132
00:13:40,201 --> 00:13:42,179
Sapphire, dear!
Where are you, my little one?

133
00:13:44,461 --> 00:13:46,436
- Poor Queen!
- She will still live...

134
00:13:46,461 --> 00:13:47,069
..only two days!

135
00:14:11,567 --> 00:14:13,256
The temperature is dropping.

136
00:14:14,501 --> 00:14:17,144
But they are icicles!
I'm starting to feel cold.

137
00:14:20,141 --> 00:14:22,770
Thank goodness I have the fire, otherwise
I would risk freezing to death.

138
00:14:32,875 --> 00:14:34,060
I'm getting sleepy!

139
00:14:35,501 --> 00:14:39,096
I'm sleepy, but I must try
not to fall asleep.

140
00:14:39,141 --> 00:14:40,086
My time has never been
so precious!

141
00:14:47,981 --> 00:14:49,621
What is happening to me?
Why am I so sleepy?

142
00:14:59,007 --> 00:15:04,052
A day and a half has already passed!
If Sapphire doesn't return by tomorrow,

143
00:15:04,101 --> 00:15:05,498
my dear wife will die!

144
00:15:05,522 --> 00:15:07,216
Sapphire will be killed by the monsters.

145
00:15:09,374 --> 00:15:12,530
Where could Sapphire be?
In the second valley?

146
00:15:14,461 --> 00:15:17,196
Do you know where the Three Valleys are?

147
00:15:17,887 --> 00:15:19,756
Will you take me there, dear friends?

148
00:15:19,781 --> 00:15:21,325
Hooray!

149
00:15:42,421 --> 00:15:45,174
I fell asleep
and it's past noon!

150
00:15:45,621 --> 00:15:47,238
It's the monster of the second valley!

151
00:16:29,047 --> 00:16:30,459
Sapphire!

152
00:16:48,054 --> 00:16:50,102
It's too tight!

153
00:16:50,126 --> 00:16:52,057
My sword!
Just a little more effort!

154
00:17:04,021 --> 00:17:04,884
I'm coming, Sapphire!

155
00:17:09,901 --> 00:17:10,328
Tink, give me the fire!

156
00:17:10,352 --> 00:17:12,096
Take it!

157
00:17:12,634 --> 00:17:14,013
Thanks, Tink!

158
00:17:40,221 --> 00:17:41,699
You managed to defeat it!

159
00:17:41,724 --> 00:17:43,897
But I still have to get past
the last monster,

160
00:17:43,941 --> 00:17:44,670
the one in the third valley.
Let's hurry!

161
00:17:46,221 --> 00:17:47,398
What do you say, great eagle?

162
00:17:48,821 --> 00:17:51,335
Take a little piece
of the monster's tail?

163
00:17:51,381 --> 00:17:53,656
Do you really think
it could be useful to us?

164
00:17:55,341 --> 00:17:56,053
Alright!

165
00:18:00,807 --> 00:18:03,819
Damn, it's so cold!
It's colder than ice!

166
00:18:03,843 --> 00:18:05,210
I'll put it in my sword's scabbard.

167
00:18:06,541 --> 00:18:07,566
Let's go, now!

168
00:18:09,594 --> 00:18:11,481
Thank you, great eagle! Goodbye, friend!

169
00:18:11,505 --> 00:18:13,299
Goodbye!

170
00:18:14,740 --> 00:18:18,021
Do you want to come with us?

171
00:18:19,501 --> 00:18:22,254
I wonder what
the monster of the third valley will be like.

172
00:19:09,901 --> 00:19:11,274
Sapphire, look.

173
00:19:11,751 --> 00:19:12,984
There is no way through.

174
00:19:13,009 --> 00:19:15,180
Do you see that grass over there?

175
00:19:15,204 --> 00:19:17,170
It must be the herb we are looking for!

176
00:19:17,195 --> 00:19:19,172
How will we reach it?

177
00:19:21,079 --> 00:19:22,316
I can't go around this way... that way's no good either!

178
00:19:22,594 --> 00:19:24,005
Let's cross the swamp!

179
00:19:24,221 --> 00:19:26,689
- But it's terrifying!
- We have no choice

180
00:19:26,713 --> 00:19:29,273
Let's see how deep
this muddy water is.

181
00:19:39,141 --> 00:19:42,099
We have to get to the
grass! We can't stay here!

182
00:19:45,901 --> 00:19:48,210
Would you two like to go
to get the grass?

183
00:19:48,261 --> 00:19:49,564
Do you feel up to
crossing the swamp?

184
00:20:25,061 --> 00:20:26,781
Watch out! These are the
monsters of the third valley!

185
00:20:29,541 --> 00:20:30,221
Terrifying!

186
00:20:33,301 --> 00:20:34,764
I must reach that grass!

187
00:20:51,561 --> 00:20:52,597
Tink!

188
00:20:53,861 --> 00:20:56,500
Please save me, Sapphire! Help!

189
00:20:57,501 --> 00:20:58,765
Hang on, Tink! I will save you!

190
00:21:00,100 --> 00:21:02,461
Sapphire! Help!

191
00:21:02,485 --> 00:21:04,595
I will use the little piece of
the tail of the ice monster!

192
00:21:18,901 --> 00:21:19,893
They have frozen!

193
00:21:24,101 --> 00:21:24,937
Damn, this ice is cold!

194
00:21:24,961 --> 00:21:26,937
I can't stop! Tink!

195
00:21:27,394 --> 00:21:29,066
Here I am!

196
00:21:33,400 --> 00:21:36,500
We'd better skate!
We'll move faster!

197
00:21:43,021 --> 00:21:44,552
This will be enough!
Let's go back home!

198
00:21:44,576 --> 00:21:46,163
Good heavens,
today is the third day!

199
00:21:47,201 --> 00:21:50,019
We must be back at the
palace before the sun sets.

200
00:21:50,061 --> 00:21:51,221
Quick, let's run!

201
00:21:59,021 --> 00:22:01,325
We won't make it!

202
00:22:02,101 --> 00:22:04,410
We can ask the robins to
bring the herb to the castle!

203
00:22:04,461 --> 00:22:07,419
Right! Little friends, do you
feel up to flying to the castle?

204
00:22:13,861 --> 00:22:17,908
Here! Pour the herb juice
on the Queen's wound! Got it?

205
00:22:20,154 --> 00:22:22,660
Please! The life of my
mother depends on you!

206
00:22:41,501 --> 00:22:43,580
Oh, Lord, please!
Let my wife be saved!

207
00:22:49,701 --> 00:22:52,135
Is there at least some hope?

208
00:23:06,701 --> 00:23:09,420
Why are you all standing
petrified staring at me?

209
00:23:10,907 --> 00:23:14,102
What?! You're alive?

210
00:23:14,127 --> 00:23:15,618
What did you say, Nylon?

211
00:23:16,527 --> 00:23:19,819
I was saying that he returned safe
and sound with the herb, that bastard...!

212
00:23:21,667 --> 00:23:23,091
Our dear Prince!

213
00:23:23,341 --> 00:23:27,016
He's not dead, damn him! I'm
going crazy! I'll never get rid of him!

214
00:23:27,061 --> 00:23:30,770
But I must succeed! I must
succeed! I must! I must!

215
00:23:32,114 --> 00:23:36,981
Did you see? He must have gone
crazy with joy over your recovery.

216
00:23:37,005 --> 00:23:41,057
- Hooray!
- Long live the Queen!

217
00:23:59,527 --> 00:24:02,701
- Did you make it in time?
- Yes, the Queen is safe!

218
00:24:03,861 --> 00:24:06,580
- What a relief!
- We made it, mom!

219
00:24:36,461 --> 00:24:40,081
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

220
00:24:40,082 --> 00:24:43,442
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

221
00:24:43,443 --> 00:24:47,213
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

222
00:24:47,214 --> 00:24:50,375
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

223
00:24:50,376 --> 00:24:54,189
♪ Sen'nen man'nen hyakuman-nen ♪
A thousand years, ten thousand years, a million years,

224
00:24:54,190 --> 00:24:57,486
♪ Ribbon de tsunagou ichioku-nen ♪
Let’s connect with ribbons for a billion years!

225
00:24:57,487 --> 00:25:01,492
♪ Akuma ga kute mo arashi ga kute mo ♪
Even if devils come, even if storms arrive,

226
00:25:01,493 --> 00:25:04,931
♪ tsunaida kokoro wa hanarenai ♪
Our bonded hearts will never part.

227
00:25:04,932 --> 00:25:08,552
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

228
00:25:08,553 --> 00:25:11,913
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

229
00:25:11,914 --> 00:25:15,684
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

230
00:25:15,685 --> 00:25:18,846
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

231
00:25:18,870 --> 00:25:30,417
